  <item>
    <title>S2E5（上）. 再有人说护士工作只是打针发药，我就把这期节目链接甩给TA</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69bd3eef2d318777c9e98067</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69bd3eef2d318777c9e98067</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 20 Mar 2026 12:39:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>hello！好久不见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期的嘉宾邀请到了国内护理本科、国外护理硕士毕业后目前在墨尔本工作的果果学姐，来分享有关护理的“冷”知识👀</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>护士的工作范围    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="404">06:44</a> 病房和手术室里的东西都是哪来的？</span></li><span>      </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="588">09:48</a> 护士也会有自己的门诊？</span></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span>  </span><li><span>认可自己职业身份的时刻    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="906">15:06</a> “我要是某某岗位就好了”，这样的想法你有过吗？</span></li><span>      </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">20:16</a> "你要知其然，必须要知其所以然"</span></li><span>      </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1540">25:40</a> “护理是一个非常看重评估的内容”</span></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span>  </span><li><span>从每个细微处“与时俱进”    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1769">29:29</a> 护士的“科学研究”</span></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span>  </span><li><span>护士的工作制度    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2236">37:16</a> 依据病区而调整的“n”班倒&nbsp;</span></li><span>      </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2764">46:04</a> 倒班会对健康造成怎样的影响？</span></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎵 BGM：郭静《在树上唱歌》</span></p><span></span><p><span>“爱一朵花不猜它能开多久</span></p><span></span><p><span>放宽了心情 把什么都变美了”</span></p><span></span><p><span>春天快乐！🌸😊🌳💗</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/663834f5ce76f678142cc6f4/lnMzCtVgGp7crrW39XYT--INW1sA.m4a" length="50662685" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:52:09</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkiDslC90EDHXm0gWiTQivxwhqAe.jpg"/>
